  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given that, coordinates of two fixed points <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math> are <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> respectively<br />Let variable point <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math> is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/e3c07ada-7824-4617-8b51-7feb4849abc9.png\" style=\"width:1.61319in;height:1.28681in\" /><br />From the adjoining figure,<br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br />But <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></math> so we have<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Hence, locus of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
    "image": null
  },
